    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Ravenwing Dark Talon",
    "summary": "As [your opponent's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, pick 1 enemy unit that is **visible** to this unit and up to 24\" from it, other than an **AIRCRAFT** or **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** unit. That unit is **slowed** until [your opponent's next Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends.\n\nWhenever a **slowed** unit is picked to move during [your opponent's Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), roll a D6 unless it **[remains stationary](vsdata:core-rule/remain-stationary)**:\n\n- 1-4: it takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** and gets -2\" M\n- 5-6: it takes 2D3 mortal wounds and gets -3\" M",
